<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica bourse says CDC results qualified.</title>
<headline>SAfrica bourse says CDC results qualified.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Thursday the audit opinion on Consolidated Diamond Corporation Ltd's year results had been qualified.</p>
<p>It said the company's listing on the exchange would be annotated a &quot;Q&quot; from Friday.</p>
<p>The annotation would be removed once the company produced an unqualified audit opinion, the exchange added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
